    {
      "text": "Blend the juice of the lime with the avocado flesh, the peeled garlic and half of the rocket."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the feta, honey, olive oil, pepper and salt and blend again."
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain the pasta, leaving a little of the cooking water in the pot with it."
